 period horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"current gift-funded strip segment\" style=\"--v:1\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-3-2-2\" data-name=\"current credit-funded strip segment\" style=\"--v:8\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-3-3\" data-name=\"current period total value\">9</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-4\" data-name=\"week 4 previous strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-4-1\" data-name=\"previous period tag\">Previous</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--prev\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-4-2\" data-name=\"previous period horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-4-2-1\" data-name=\"previous gift-funded strip segment\" style=\"--v:2\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-4-2-2\" data-name=\"previous credit-funded strip segment\" style=\"--v:5\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-5-4-3\" data-name=\"previous period total value\">7</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"alt\" data-kid=\"1-6\" data-name=\"narrow strips mobile demo section\">\n<div class=\"alt__head\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" data-name=\"strips section header row\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"narrow strips section heading\">Narrow strips</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"phone\" data-kid=\"1-6-2\" data-name=\"mobile phone-width demo container\">\n<div class=\"phone__head\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile demo header bar\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile demo title heading\">Cooks</h3>\n<div aria-label=\"Range\" class=\"segmented\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2\" data-name=\"compact period range segmented control\" role=\"group\">\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"1 week compact toggle button\" type=\"button\">1w</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"1 month compact toggle button\" type=\"button\">1m</button>\n<button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"1 year compact toggle button\" type=\"button\">1y</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"stats\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"compact key stats row\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cooks stat item\"><b class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"cooks stat value\">33</b><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"cooks stat label\">cooks</span></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"previous cooks stat item\"><b class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"previous cooks stat value\">26</b><span data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"previous cooks stat label\">previous</span></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-3\" data-name=\"cooks change stat item\"><b class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"cooks increase value\">+7</b><em data-kid=\"1-6-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"cooks change percentage\">+27%</em></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"legend\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"compact funding legend\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1\" data-name=\"gift legend item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sw sw--gift\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"gift color swatch\"></span>Gift</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2\" data-name=\"credit legend item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sw sw--credit\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"credit color swatch\"></span>Credit</li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3\" data-name=\"previous legend item\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sw sw--prev\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"previous color swatch\"></span>Previous</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"lanes\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4\" data-name=\"compact period lanes list\">\n<button aria-label=\"7 to 13 October 2026: 8 cooks, 2 gift-funded, 6 Credit-funded. Previous period 9 cooks. Down 1.\" class=\"lane\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1\" data-name=\"week 1 compact lane\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"lane__date\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"week 1 compact date label\">7–13 Oct</span>\n<span class=\"lane__diff\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"week 1 compact difference value\">−1</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"week 1 current compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"current compact tag\">Now</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--now\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"current compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"current gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:2\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"current credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:6\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-3-3\" data-name=\"current compact total value\">8</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-4\" data-name=\"week 1 previous compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-4-1\" data-name=\"previous compact tag\">Prev</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--prev\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-4-2\" data-name=\"previous compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"previous gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:2\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"previous credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:7\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-1-4-3\" data-name=\"previous compact total value\">9</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"14 to 20 October 2026: 9 cooks, 1 gift-funded, 8 Credit-funded. Previous period 6 cooks. Up 3.\" class=\"lane\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2\" data-name=\"week 2 compact lane\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"lane__date\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"week 2 compact date label\">14–20 Oct</span>\n<span class=\"lane__diff\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"week 2 compact difference value\">+3</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"week 2 current compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"current compact tag\">Now</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--now\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"current compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"current gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:1\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"current credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:8\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"current compact total value\">9</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-4\" data-name=\"week 2 previous compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"previous compact tag\">Prev</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--prev\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"previous compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"previous gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:2\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"previous credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:4\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-2-4-3\" data-name=\"previous compact total value\">6</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"21 to 27 October 2026: 7 cooks, 2 gift-funded, 5 Credit-funded. Previous period 4 cooks. Up 3.\" class=\"lane\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3\" data-name=\"week 3 compact lane\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"lane__date\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"week 3 compact date label\">21–27 Oct</span>\n<span class=\"lane__diff\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"week 3 compact difference value\">+3</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-3\" data-name=\"week 3 current compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-3-1\" data-name=\"current compact tag\">Now</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--now\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-3-2\" data-name=\"current compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"current gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:2\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"current credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:5\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-3-3\" data-name=\"current compact total value\">7</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-4\" data-name=\"week 3 previous compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-4-1\" data-name=\"previous compact tag\">Prev</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--prev\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-4-2\" data-name=\"previous compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"previous gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:1\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"previous credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:3\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-3-4-3\" data-name=\"previous compact total value\">4</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"28 October to 3 November 2026: 9 cooks, 1 gift-funded, 8 Credit-funded. Previous period 7 cooks. Up 2.\" class=\"lane\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4\" data-name=\"week 4 compact lane\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"lane__date\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"week 4 compact date label\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n<span class=\"lane__diff\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"week 4 compact difference value\">+2</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-3\" data-name=\"week 4 current compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-3-1\" data-name=\"current compact tag\">Now</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--now\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-3-2\" data-name=\"current compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"current gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:1\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"current credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:8\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-3-3\" data-name=\"current compact total value\">9</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"lane__row\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-4\" data-name=\"week 4 previous compact strip row\">\n<span class=\"lane__tag\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-4-1\" data-name=\"previous compact tag\">Prev</span>\n<span class=\"strip strip--prev\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-4-2\" data-name=\"previous compact horizontal strip\"><span class=\"sg\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"previous gift-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:2\"></span><span class=\"sc\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-4-2-2\" data-name=\"previous credit-funded compact segment\" style=\"--v:5\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"lane__tot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-4-4-4-3\" data-name=\"previous compact total value\">7</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"phone__foot\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-5\" data-name=\"mobile demo footer container\"><a class=\"textlink\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-5-1\" data-name=\"view monthly data link\" href=\"/dashboard\">View monthly data</a></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-04T15:18:01.136134+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-04T21:57:14.215636+00:00",
      "id": "var_f793f99d31c8",
      "contentHeight": 1572
    },
    "var_bucketstates_1106": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "bucketstates_1106",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 7953,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n:root{\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  --background: light-dark(hsl(38 42% 96%), hsl(30 12% 8%));\n  --surface-2: light-dark(hsl(36 34% 93%), hsl(30 9% 15%));\n  --ink: light-dark(hsl(28 24% 15%), hsl(36 28% 93%));\n  --ink-muted: light-dark(hsl(30 9% 38%), hsl(30 8% 66%));\n  --ink-faint: light-dark(hsl(30 7% 50%), hsl(30 7% 54%));\n  --rule: light-dark(hsl(34 24% 85%), hsl(30 8% 21%));\n  --rule-hair: light-dark(hsl(34 22% 90%), hsl(30 8% 16%));\n  --rule-strong: light-dark(hsl(32 18% 70%), hsl(30 8% 30%));\n  --accent: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 37%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --gift: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 43%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  /* text-safe series colours: the fill hue is 4.00:1 on paper, below the 4.5:1 small text needs */\n  --gift-ink: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 39%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --credit-ink: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 36%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n  --serif: ui-serif, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;\n  background:var(--background);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);\n  font-size:14px;\n  line-height:1.45;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\np,ul{margin:0}\nul{padding:0;list-style:none}\n.num{font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n\n.page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 48px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.head h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em}\n.periods{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:4px}\n\n/* ---------------- mark: one element per bucket ---------------- */\n.mark{\n  --c-gift: var(--gift);\n  --c-credit: var(--accent);\n  display:block;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  inline-size:var(--w, clamp(24px,32%,64px));\n  block-size:var(--h, calc(var(--v) / var(--max, 10) * 100%));\n  background-image:var(--fill);\n  background-size:100% 100%;\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.mark[data-shape='gift']{--fill:linear-gradient(var(--c-gift) 0 0)}\n.mark[data-shape='credit']{--fill:linear-gradient(var(--c-credit) 0 0)}\n.mark[data-shape='both']{\n  --split:clamp(3px,calc(var(--n-gift) / var(--v) * 100%),calc(100% - 5px));\n  --fill:linear-gradient(to top,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n}\n.mark[data-previous]{\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n/* an empty bucket is a stub, not a gap */\n.zero{inline-size:var(--w, clamp(24px,32%,64px));block-size:3px;background:var(--ink-muted)}\n.start{inline-size:2px;block-size:14px;background:var(--ink-faint);margin-inline-end:auto}\n\n/* ---------------- values: part of the graph ---------------- */\n.vals{\n  display:flex;\n  justify-content:space-between;\n  gap:4px;\n  inline-size:var(--w, clamp(24px,32%,64px));\n  font-family:var(--mono);\n  font-size:11px;\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  line-height:1.25;\n}\n.vals[data-shape='gift'],\n.vals[data-shape='credit']{justify-content:flex-start}\n.vals[data-shape='none']{justify-content:center}\n.v--gift{color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.v--credit{color:var(--credit-ink)}\n.v--none{color:var(--ink-faint)}\n\n/* ---------------- legend ---------------- */\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap}\n.legend li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}\n.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:1px;display:inline-block}\n.sw--gift{background:var(--gift)}\n.sw--credit{background:var(--accent)}\n.sw--prev{\n  background:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background)) 0 calc(50% - 1px),\n    var(--background) calc(50% - 1px) calc(50% + 1px),\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background)) calc(50% + 1px) 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n.sw--start{width:2px;height:12px;background:var(--ink-faint);border-radius:0}\n\n/* ---------------- figure ---------------- */\n.fig{margin:0}\n.fig__head h2{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.fig__period{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:3px}\n.fig .legend{margin-top:14px}\n\n.plot{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));\n  block-size:180px;\n  margin-top:22px;\n  border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong);\n}\n.plot--four{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.plot--twelve{grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));block-size:150px}\n.slot{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;gap:8px;block-size:100%}\n\n.labels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:8px}\n.labels--twelve{grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.labels li{\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;\n  container-type:inline-size;\n}\n.labels .date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-faint);white-space:nowrap}\n.labels--twelve .date{font-size:11px}\n\n/* values drop out per cell when the cell is too narrow for them */\n@container (max-width:56px){\n  .vals{display:none}\n}\n\n/* ---------------- state reference ---------------- */\n.block{margin-top:38px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.block h2{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}\n.block__note{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:68ch}\n.plot--ref{margin-top:24px}\n\n.wide{max-width:560px}\n\n/* ---------------- narrow: lanes ---------------- */\n.narrow{\n  width:390px;max-width:100%;margin-top:18px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:10px;\n}\n.narrow h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.narrow .periods{font-size:12px}\n.narrow .legend{gap:12px;margin-top:10px;font-size:11.5px}\n.lanes{margin-top:12px}\n.lane{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;\n  column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;\n  padding:11px 0;\n  border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);\n}\n.lane:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n.lane__date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n.lane__delta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);text-align:right}\n.lane__bars{grid-column:1 / -1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:8px;row-gap:1px}\n.lane__tag{grid-column:1;align-self:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n.strip{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);\n  --c-credit:var(--accent);\n  --split:calc(var(--n-gift) / var(--n-total) * 100%);\n  grid-column:2;\n  align-self:center;\n  display:block;\n  block-size:11px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--n-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.strip--prev{\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  --split:calc(var(--p-gift) / var(--p-total) * 100%);\n  block-size:9px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--p-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n.lane__vals{\n  grid-column:2;\n  display:flex;\n  justify-content:space-between;\n  gap:4px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--n-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  font-family:var(--mono);\n  font-size:11px;\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n}\n.lane__vals[data-shape='gift'],\n.lane__vals[data-shape='credit']{justify-content:flex-start}\n/* the previous row's numbers span the previous bar, not the current one */\n.lane__vals--prev{inline-size:calc(var(--p-total) / var(--max) * 100%)}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>Bucket states</h1>\n    <p class=\"periods\">Final version: numbers are part of the graph, keyed by colour to the fill; no tooltip, no table</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <figure class=\"fig\">\n      <figcaption>\n        <h2>Cooks</h2>\n        <p class=\"fig__period\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n        <ul class=\"legend\">\n          <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift-funded</li>\n          <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit-funded</li>\n          <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous period</li>\n          <li><span class=\"sw sw--start\"></span>History starts</li>\n        </ul>\n      </figcaption>\n\n      <div class=\"plot plot--four\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <div class=\"slot\">\n          <span class=\"start\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:2\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"slot\">\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:1\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"slot\">\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:7;--n-gift:2\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"slot\">\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:7;--n-gift:2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:1\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"labels labels--four\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span>\n          <span class=\"date\">7–13 Oct</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span>\n          <span class=\"date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">5</span></span>\n          <span class=\"date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span>\n          <span class=\"date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Values follow the state</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">Two numbers when both funding types appear, pushed to the ends of the bar. One number, aligned to the start, when only one is used. A muted zero when the bucket is empty — the stub carries the fact that it was counted.</p>\n    <div class=\"plot plot--ref plot--four\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--max:10\">\n      <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:2\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" style=\"--v:6;--n-gift:6\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" style=\"--v:7;--n-gift:0\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"zero\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"labels labels--four\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span>\n        <span class=\"date\">both</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"gift\"><span class=\"v--gift\">6</span></span>\n        <span class=\"date\">gift only</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"credit\"><span class=\"v--credit\">7</span></span>\n        <span class=\"date\">credit only</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"none\"><span class=\"v--none\">0</span></span>\n        <span class=\"date\">empty</span>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Twelve buckets, narrow slots</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">The same rules in a 560px container. Below a 56px cell the numbers drop out and the chart becomes shape only — decided per bucket by a container query, so a wide month view keeps its numbers while a cramped year view does not.</p>\n    <div class=\"wide\">\n      <div class=\"plot plot--twelve\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:3;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:5;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:3;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:6;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"zero\" style=\"--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" style=\"--v:4;--n-gift:4;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:7;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:0;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:5;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"labels labels--twelve\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">2</span></span><span class=\"date\">Feb</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">3</span></span><span class=\"date\">Mar</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">3</span><span class=\"v--credit\">5</span></span><span class=\"date\">Apr</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span><span class=\"date\">May</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">4</span></span><span class=\"date\">Jun</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"none\"><span class=\"v--none\">0</span></span><span class=\"date\">Jul</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"gift\"><span class=\"v--gift\">4</span></span><span class=\"date\">Aug</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span><span class=\"date\">Sep</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">7</span></span><span class=\"date\">Oct</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"credit\"><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span><span class=\"date\">Nov</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">3</span></span><span class=\"date\">Dec</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\" data-shape=\"both\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span><span class=\"date\">Jan</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>At 390px</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">Sideways gradient, numbers beneath it. Two numbers pushed to the ends of their own segments, one number aligned to the start when only one funding type is used, nothing when the week was empty.</p>\n    <div class=\"narrow\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"periods\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">—</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:8\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:8\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">+1</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:9\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:8\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--p-total:8\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">−2</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:7\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">5</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--p-total:9\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">7</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">+2</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:9\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--p-total:7\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">5</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">4–10 Nov</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">+3</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:4;--n-total:4\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"gift\" style=\"--n-total:4\"><span class=\"v--gift\">4</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:1\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"gift\" style=\"--p-total:1\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-06T21:39:18.601474+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-07T00:16:10.304Z",
      "id": "var_bucketstates_1106",
      "overrides": {},
      "contentHeight": 2034
    },
    "var_sideways_1107": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "sideways_1107",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 9493,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n:root{\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  --background: light-dark(hsl(38 42% 96%), hsl(30 12% 8%));\n  --surface-2: light-dark(hsl(36 34% 93%), hsl(30 9% 15%));\n  --ink: light-dark(hsl(28 24% 15%), hsl(36 28% 93%));\n  --ink-muted: light-dark(hsl(30 9% 38%), hsl(30 8% 66%));\n  --ink-faint: light-dark(hsl(30 7% 50%), hsl(30 7% 54%));\n  --rule: light-dark(hsl(34 24% 85%), hsl(30 8% 21%));\n  --rule-hair: light-dark(hsl(34 22% 90%), hsl(30 8% 16%));\n  --rule-strong: light-dark(hsl(32 18% 70%), hsl(30 8% 30%));\n  --accent: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 37%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --gift: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 43%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --gift-ink: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 39%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --credit-ink: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 36%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n  --serif: ui-serif, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\np,ul{margin:0}\nul{padding:0;list-style:none}\n.page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 48px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.head h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em}\n.periods{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:4px}\n.block{margin-top:34px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.block h2{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}\n.block__note{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:70ch}\n\n/* ---------------- weight ladder ---------------- */\n.wgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px;max-width:520px}\n.wcell{border:1px solid var(--rule-hair);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px 8px;background:var(--surface-2)}\n.wcell b{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.wcell i{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-style:normal;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.04em}\n.wbig{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:12px;max-width:520px}\n.wbig b{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* ---------------- figure placement ---------------- */\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}\n.legend li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}\n.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:1px;display:inline-block}\n.sw--gift{background:var(--gift)}\n.sw--credit{background:var(--accent)}\n.sw--prev{\n  background:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background)) 0 calc(50% - 1px),\n    var(--background) calc(50% - 1px) calc(50% + 1px),\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background)) calc(50% + 1px) 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n.sw--start{width:2px;height:12px;background:var(--ink-faint)}\n\n.card{\n  width:390px;max-width:100%;margin-top:18px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:10px;background:var(--background);\n}\n.card h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.card .periods{font-size:12px}\n.card .legend{gap:12px;margin-top:10px;font-size:11.5px}\n\n.cap{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:70ch}\n\n.strip{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);\n  --c-credit:var(--accent);\n  --split:calc(var(--n-gift) / var(--n-total) * 100%);\n  display:block;\n  block-size:11px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--n-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.strip--prev{\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  --split:calc(var(--p-gift) / var(--p-total) * 100%);\n  block-size:9px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--p-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n\n/* variant A — figures hug the bar, no room for a word */\n.lanes{margin-top:12px}\n.lane{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;padding:11px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair)}\n.lane:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n.lane__date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n.lane__delta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);text-align:right;font-weight:600}\n.lane__bars{grid-column:1 / -1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:8px;row-gap:1px}\n.lane__tag{grid-column:1;align-self:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n.lane__bars .strip{grid-column:2;align-self:center}\n.lane__vals{\n  grid-column:2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--n-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;\n}\n.lane__vals[data-shape='gift'],\n.lane__vals[data-shape='credit']{justify-content:flex-start}\n.lane__vals--prev{inline-size:calc(var(--p-total) / var(--max) * 100%)}\n.v--gift{color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.v--credit{color:var(--credit-ink)}\n\n/* variant B — a fixed rail, so the figures stop depending on bar width */\n.lane2{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 88px;\n  column-gap:12px;row-gap:5px;\n  padding:11px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);align-items:center;\n}\n.lane2:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n.lane2__head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\n.lane2__date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n.lane2__delta{margin-inline-start:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-weight:600}\n.lane2__bars{display:grid;row-gap:4px}\n.rail{\n  grid-column:2;grid-row:1 / span 2;align-self:center;\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 27px 25px;column-gap:6px;row-gap:2px;\n  font-size:11px;\n}\n.rail--head{grid-row:1;align-self:start}\n.lane2--head{padding-block:2px 4px;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair)}\n.lane2--head .rail__f{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.rail__k{color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:10.5px}\n.rail__f{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;\n}\n.rail__f--prev{color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.rail--head .rail__f{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.rail__dash{color:var(--ink-faint);text-align:right;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>Sideways: the weight of a number, and where it sits</h1>\n    <p class=\"periods\">8 marks, 390px. The same four weeks with the figures in two places.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Weight, and whether the face has one</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">A bare numeral carries the value by itself, so it wants stroke weight. The catch is the stack: system monos often ship no bold face, so 700 is synthesised. At 11px that smears strokes and closes the counters of 6, 8 and 9. The top row is the numeral at the size it is used; the bottom row is the same face at 40px, where a fake bold is obvious.</p>\n    <ul class=\"wgrid\">\n      <li class=\"wcell\"><b style=\"font-weight:400\">2 &nbsp; 6</b><i>400</i></li>\n      <li class=\"wcell\"><b style=\"font-weight:500\">2 &nbsp; 6</b><i>500</i></li>\n      <li class=\"wcell\"><b style=\"font-weight:600\">2 &nbsp; 6</b><i>600</i></li>\n      <li class=\"wcell\"><b style=\"font-weight:700\">2 &nbsp; 6</b><i>700</i></li>\n    </ul>\n    <ul class=\"wbig\">\n      <li><b style=\"font-weight:400\">689</b></li>\n      <li><b style=\"font-weight:500\">689</b></li>\n      <li><b style=\"font-weight:600\">689</b></li>\n      <li><b style=\"font-weight:700\">689</b></li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Variant A — figures hug the bar</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">What the sheet does now. The figures sit inside the bar's own width, so they inherit its limits: no room for a word, and two numbers only fit when the bar is wide enough to separate them. Weight alone has to do the work of saying \"this is a value\".</p>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"periods\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">—</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:8\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:8\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">+1</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:9\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:8\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--p-total:8\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">6</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">−2</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:7\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">5</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--p-total:9\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">7</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__delta\">+2</span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Now</span>\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--n-total:9\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">8</span></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__bars\">\n            <span class=\"lane__tag\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"lane__vals lane__vals--prev\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--p-total:7\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">5</span></span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Variant B — a rail of its own</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">The figures leave the bar and take a fixed 88px column, right-aligned, so they line up down the whole list and there is room for the word. \"Free\" and \"paid\" label the rows once each, and the Now / Prev headings cover both periods, which is what removes \"just show the number\". The bar keeps whatever width is left, and previous-period figures are washed because the row label already says which figure is which.</p>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"periods\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane2 lane2--head\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\"></span>\n          <span class=\"rail rail--head\"><span class=\"rail__k\"></span><span class=\"rail__f\">Now</span><span class=\"rail__f\">Prev</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__head\">\n            <span class=\"lane2__date\">7–13 Oct</span>\n            <span class=\"lane2__delta\">—</span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\">\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:8\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"rail\">\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__dash\">–</span>\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">6</span><span class=\"rail__dash\">–</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__head\">\n            <span class=\"lane2__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <span class=\"lane2__delta\">+1</span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\">\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:8\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"rail\">\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">8</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">6</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__head\">\n            <span class=\"lane2__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <span class=\"lane2__delta\">−2</span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\">\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:7\"></span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:9\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"rail\">\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">5</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">7</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__head\">\n            <span class=\"lane2__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <span class=\"lane2__delta\">+2</span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\">\n            <span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span>\n            <span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:7\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"rail\">\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">8</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">5</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"cap\">What the rail costs: 88px off every bar. At 390px the bar's usable length falls from about 250px to about 160px, so a difference of one cook is 6% of the bar instead of 10%. That is the trade — legible figures against a shorter scale.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>What this changes</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">The figures stop being part of the mark and become a column of the list. That is a different object from a chart with labels: it is a table that happens to draw a bar, which is defensible for this data — the pairs are the point, and there are never more than 24 of them.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-07T00:48:55.134264+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-07T00:49:41.387Z",
      "id": "var_sideways_1107",
      "overrides": {},
      "contentHeight": 1894
    },
    "var_markcount_1107": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "markcount_1107",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 11033,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n:root{\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  --background: light-dark(hsl(38 42% 96%), hsl(30 12% 8%));\n  --surface-2: light-dark(hsl(36 34% 93%), hsl(30 9% 15%));\n  --ink: light-dark(hsl(28 24% 15%), hsl(36 28% 93%));\n  --ink-muted: light-dark(hsl(30 9% 38%), hsl(30 8% 66%));\n  --ink-faint: light-dark(hsl(30 7% 50%), hsl(30 7% 54%));\n  --rule: light-dark(hsl(34 24% 85%), hsl(30 8% 21%));\n  --rule-hair: light-dark(hsl(34 22% 90%), hsl(30 8% 16%));\n  --rule-strong: light-dark(hsl(32 18% 70%), hsl(30 8% 30%));\n  --accent: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 37%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --gift: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 43%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --gift-ink: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 39%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --credit-ink: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 36%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n  --serif: ui-serif, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\np,ul{margin:0}\nul{padding:0;list-style:none}\n.page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 48px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.head h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em}\n.periods{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:4px}\n.block{margin-top:34px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.block h2{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}\n.block__note{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:72ch}\n\n/* the arithmetic */\n.calc{border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px;font-size:12.5px}\n.calc th,.calc td{text-align:left;padding:7px 18px 7px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);vertical-align:baseline}\n.calc th{font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);letter-spacing:.02em;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong)}\n.calc td.n{font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}\n.ok{color:var(--ink)}\n.no{color:var(--accent)}\n\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}\n.legend li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:1px;display:inline-block}\n.sw--gift{background:var(--gift)}\n.sw--credit{background:var(--accent)}\n.sw--prev{\n  background:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background)) 0 calc(50% - 1px),\n    var(--background) calc(50% - 1px) calc(50% + 1px),\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background)) calc(50% + 1px) 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n\n.card{\n  width:390px;max-width:100%;margin-top:16px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:10px;\n}\n.card h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.card .periods{font-size:12px}\n\n/* ---------------- lanes, tight: the count is the subject ---------------- */\n.lanes{margin-top:10px}\n.lane2{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 78px;column-gap:10px;row-gap:4px;\n  padding:7px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);align-items:center;\n}\n.lane2:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n.lane2__date{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n.lane2__delta{margin-inline-start:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-weight:600}\n.lane2__bars{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;display:grid;row-gap:3px}\n.lane2--head{padding-block:2px 4px}\n.lane2--head .rail__f{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.strip{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);--c-credit:var(--accent);\n  --split:calc(var(--n-gift) / var(--n-total) * 100%);\n  display:block;block-size:8px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--n-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.strip--prev{\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  --split:calc(var(--p-gift) / var(--p-total) * 100%);\n  block-size:6px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--p-total) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n.rail{\n  grid-column:2;grid-row:1 / span 2;align-self:center;\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 25px 25px;column-gap:5px;row-gap:1px;\n  font-size:10.5px;\n}\n.rail--head{grid-row:1;align-self:start}\n.rail__k{color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:10px}\n.rail__f{font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-align:right}\n.rail__f--prev{color:var(--ink-muted)}\n\n/* ---------------- columns, for comparison ---------------- */\n.plot{display:grid;block-size:170px;margin-top:16px;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong)}\n.plot--week{grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));block-size:150px}\n.plot--year{grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr));block-size:120px}\n.plot--phone{width:356px;max-width:100%}\n.slot{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;gap:6px;block-size:100%}\n.mark{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);--c-credit:var(--accent);\n  display:block;box-sizing:border-box;\n  inline-size:var(--w,24px);\n  block-size:calc(var(--v) / var(--max,10) * 100%);\n  background-image:var(--fill);background-size:100% 100%;background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.mark[data-shape='gift']{--fill:linear-gradient(var(--c-gift) 0 0)}\n.mark[data-shape='credit']{--fill:linear-gradient(var(--c-credit) 0 0)}\n.mark[data-shape='both']{\n  --split:clamp(3px,calc(var(--n-gift) / var(--v) * 100%),calc(100% - 5px));\n  --fill:linear-gradient(to top,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n}\n.mark[data-previous]{\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n.zero{inline-size:var(--w,24px);block-size:3px;background:var(--ink-muted)}\n.labels{display:grid;margin-top:7px}\n.labels--week{grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.labels--year{grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.labels li{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px}\n.labels .date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);white-space:nowrap}\n.labels--year .date{font-size:9.5px}\n.vals{\n  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2px;\n  inline-size:var(--w,24px);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;\n}\n.v--gift{color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.v--credit{color:var(--credit-ink)}\n\n.frame{width:560px;max-width:100%;margin-top:16px}\n.phone{margin-top:14px}\n.cap{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:72ch}\n.cap b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n\n.attrs{border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:14px;font-size:12.5px}\n.attrs th,.attrs td{text-align:left;padding:8px 18px 8px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);vertical-align:top}\n.attrs th{font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong)}\n.attrs td:first-child{max-width:26ch}\n.attrs code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;background:var(--surface-2);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>Mark count: what 14 and 24 do to a column</h1>\n    <p class=\"periods\">7 days and 12 months, each against the period before</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>The arithmetic, before any styling</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">A paired column slot needs two marks plus the gap between them. At the 24px minimum target the marks cannot go narrower, so the floor is 56px per slot — and a slot is one bucket, not one mark. This is the whole argument in one table.</p>\n    <table class=\"calc\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Range</th><th>Buckets</th><th>Marks</th><th>Minimum width</th><th>Fits 356px</th><th>Fits 560px</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Month</td><td class=\"n\">4</td><td class=\"n\">8</td><td class=\"n\">224px</td><td class=\"ok\">yes</td><td class=\"ok\">yes</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Week</td><td class=\"n\">7</td><td class=\"n\">14</td><td class=\"n\">392px</td><td class=\"no\">no</td><td class=\"ok\">yes, barely</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Year</td><td class=\"n\">12</td><td class=\"n\">24</td><td class=\"n\">672px</td><td class=\"no\">no</td><td class=\"no\">no</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"cap\">So the month view is the only one that genuinely fits a phone as columns, which is what you expected. The week needs 392px against 356px of usable width, and the year needs 672px — more than a desktop panel, and 1.9× a phone. Sideways has no equivalent floor: a lane's bar can be any length and the row height is fixed, so 12 buckets become 12 rows and the width question disappears.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Week — 14 marks, sideways</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">Seven buckets, current above previous, both on the same scale. The rail carries both periods, so the split is stated for each.</p>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"periods\">3–10 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:4\">\n        <li class=\"lane2 lane2--head\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\"></span>\n          <span class=\"rail rail--head\"><span class=\"rail__k\"></span><span class=\"rail__f\">Now</span><span class=\"rail__f\">Prev</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Mon 3 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:2\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:0;--p-total:1\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Tue 4 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:0;--n-total:1\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:2\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Wed 5 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:2\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:0;--p-total:2\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Thu 6 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:0;--n-total:0\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:1\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Fri 7 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:0;--n-total:2\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:0;--p-total:1\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Sat 8 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:1\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:2\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\">Sun 9 Nov<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−1</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:0;--n-total:0\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:0;--p-total:1\"></span></span>\n          <span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span></span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Week — the same 14 as columns</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">At its best width, 560px. The slots fit. The figures do not belong to anything: a slot holds the current bar and its ghost, but the band beneath it has one position per slot, so <b>2 and 6 sit under two bars and claim one of them without saying which</b>. That is not a width problem and no larger screen fixes it.</p>\n    <div class=\"frame\">\n      <div class=\"plot plot--week\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--max:4\">\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" data-previous style=\"--v:1;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:2;--w:22px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" data-previous style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:2;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" style=\"--v:1;--n-gift:0;--w:22px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" data-previous style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:0;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:1;--w:22px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" data-previous style=\"--v:1;--n-gift:1;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"zero\" style=\"--w:22px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" data-previous style=\"--v:1;--n-gift:0;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:0;--w:22px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" data-previous style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:2;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" style=\"--v:1;--n-gift:1;--w:22px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" data-previous style=\"--v:1;--n-gift:0;--w:22px\"></span><span class=\"zero\" style=\"--w:22px\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"labels labels--week\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"v--credit\">0</span></span><span class=\"date\">Mon</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"v--credit\">1</span></span><span class=\"date\">Tue</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">1</span></span><span class=\"date\">Wed</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"v--credit\">0</span></span><span class=\"date\">Thu</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"v--credit\">2</span></span><span class=\"date\">Fri</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"v--credit\">0</span></span><span class=\"date\">Sat</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"vals\"><span class=\"v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"v--credit\">0</span></span><span class=\"date\">Sun</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"cap\">At 356px the same chart also loses the figures outright: the slot is 50px and the marks are flush against each other, so 56px of target does not fit in 50px of cell and the bars escape their own grid.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Year — 24 marks, sideways</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">Twelve buckets of two. Horizontally there is nothing to solve: it is a longer list, and every pair stays adjacent.</p>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"periods\">November 2025 – October 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane2 lane2--head\">\n          <span class=\"lane2__date\"></span>\n          <span class=\"rail rail--head\"><span class=\"rail__k\"></span><span class=\"rail__f\">Now</span><span class=\"rail__f\">Prev</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Nov 2025<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+1</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:3\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:2\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Dec 2025<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+1</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:5\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:4\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">3</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">3</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Jan 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+3</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:3;--n-total:8\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:5\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">3</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">5</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">3</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Feb 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−1</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:9\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:10\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">8</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">8</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Mar 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">—</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:6\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:6\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">4</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">4</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Apr 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−6</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:0;--n-total:0\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:6\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">4</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">May 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+2</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:1;--n-total:2\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:0;--p-total:0\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">1</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Jun 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+6</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:8\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:2\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">6</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Jul 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+3</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:3;--n-total:10\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:7\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">3</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">7</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">5</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Aug 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">—</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:9\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:2;--p-total:9\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">2</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">7</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">7</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Sep 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">−4</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:0;--n-total:5\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:1;--p-total:9\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">0</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">1</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">5</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">8</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"lane2\"><span class=\"lane2__date\">Oct 2026<span class=\"lane2__delta\">+4</span></span><span class=\"lane2__bars\"><span class=\"strip\" style=\"--n-gift:2;--n-total:9\"></span><span class=\"strip strip--prev\" style=\"--p-gift:0;--p-total:5\"></span></span><span class=\"rail\"><span class=\"rail__k\">free</span><span class=\"rail__f v--gift\">2</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">0</span><span class=\"rail__k\">paid</span><span class=\"rail__f v--credit\">7</span><span class=\"rail__f rail__f--prev\">5</span></span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Year — the same 24 as columns</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">Rendered at 560px with the marks shrunk to 14px, which is <b>below the 24px minimum target</b>. This is what the width forces: at the honest minimum, twelve slots need 672px. The shape survives as a barcode; the funding split and the figures do not.</p>\n    <div class=\"frame\">\n      <div class=\"plot plot--year\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" data-previous style=\"--v:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:3;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:4;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:5;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:5;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:3;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:10;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:6;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:6;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:6;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"zero\" style=\"--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"zero\" style=\"--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"gift\" data-previous style=\"--v:2;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:8;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:7;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:10;--n-gift:3;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:1;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"credit\" style=\"--v:5;--n-gift:0;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"slot\"><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" data-previous style=\"--v:5;--n-gift:0;--w:14px\"></span><span class=\"mark\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--v:9;--n-gift:2;--w:14px\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"labels labels--year\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <li><span class=\"date\">NOV</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">DEC</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">JAN</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"date\">FEB</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">MAR</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">APR</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"date\">MAY</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">JUN</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">JUL</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"date\">AUG</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">SEP</span></li><li><span class=\"date\">OCT</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>So does an attribute have to exist?</h2>\n    <p class=\"block__note\">It depends on the branch, and only one branch needs one. The point about <code>data-timeline</code> specifically is that it cannot answer the question even if you write it: a year is 12 marks today and 24 once there is a prior year, so the window name does not carry the count, and the count is what the layout would branch on.</p>\n    <table class=\"attrs\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Form decided by</th><th>Attribute needed</th><th>What it costs</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Container width</td><td>none — a container query</td><td>Two forms, two sets of findings, and a threshold that is wrong somewhere. Still cannot express 12-vs-24 at the same width.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Mark count</td><td><code>data-form</code></td><td>Not <code>data-timeline</code>: the window does not determine the count. A threshold in a component is unit-testable, unlike one in a media query.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Neither — always sideways</td><td>none</td><td>One form. The column container queries, the per-cell suppression rule and the horizontal-overflow question all leave the design.</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"cap\">The third row is the one this exhibit argues for, and the cost is honest: a column chart shows the year's silhouette at a glance, and a list does not. If that silhouette is a real job, it belongs to a separate range-level summary rather than to a second orientation of this chart.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-07T00:48:57.019432+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-07T00:49:43.228Z",
      "id": "var_markcount_1107",
      "overrides": {},
      "contentHeight": 3166
    },
    "var_rail_cq_1107": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "rail_cq_1107",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 12573,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n:root{\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  --background: light-dark(hsl(38 42% 96%), hsl(30 12% 8%));\n  --surface-2: light-dark(hsl(36 34% 93%), hsl(30 9% 15%));\n  --ink: light-dark(hsl(28 24% 15%), hsl(36 28% 93%));\n  --ink-muted: light-dark(hsl(30 9% 38%), hsl(30 8% 66%));\n  --ink-faint: light-dark(hsl(30 7% 50%), hsl(30 7% 54%));\n  --rule: light-dark(hsl(34 24% 85%), hsl(30 8% 21%));\n  --rule-hair: light-dark(hsl(34 22% 90%), hsl(30 8% 16%));\n  --rule-strong: light-dark(hsl(32 18% 70%), hsl(30 8% 30%));\n  --accent: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 37%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --gift: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 43%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --gift-ink: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 39%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --credit-ink: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 36%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n  --serif: ui-serif, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\np,ul,pre{margin:0}\nul{padding:0;list-style:none}\n.page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 48px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.head h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em}\n.sub{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:4px}\n.block{margin-top:34px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.block h2{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}\n.note{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:74ch}\n.note code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;background:var(--surface-2);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}\n\n.code{\n  margin-top:14px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface-2);\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-hair);border-radius:8px;overflow-x:auto;\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);\n  max-width:640px;\n}\n.code b{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.code em{font-style:normal;color:var(--credit-ink)}\n\n/* ---------------- the card is the query container ---------------- */\n.card{\n  width:390px;max-width:100%;margin-top:16px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:10px;\n  container-type:inline-size;\n}\n.card--wide{width:720px}\n.card h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.card .sub{font-size:12px}\n.card__size{\n  margin-top:2px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.02em;\n}\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}\n.legend li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:1px;display:inline-block}\n.sw--gift{background:var(--gift)}\n.sw--credit{background:var(--accent)}\n.sw--prev{\n  background:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background)) 0 calc(50% - 1px),\n    var(--background) calc(50% - 1px) calc(50% + 1px),\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background)) calc(50% + 1px) 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n\n/* ---------------- the lane: one DOM, two templates ---------------- */\n.lanes{margin-top:10px}\n.lane{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr);\n  grid-template-areas:\n    \"head head\"\n    \"tagN now\"\n    \"tagP prev\"\n    \"figs figs\";\n  column-gap:10px;row-gap:3px;\n  padding:11px 0;\n  border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);\n  align-items:center;\n}\n.lane:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n\n.lane__head{grid-area:head;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\n.lane__date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n.delta{margin-inline-start:auto;width:18px;height:18px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex:none;align-self:center}\n.lane__nodash{margin-inline-start:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n\n.lane__tag{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);align-self:center}\n.lane__tag--now{grid-area:tagN}\n.lane__tag--prev{grid-area:tagP}\n\n.bar{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);--c-credit:var(--accent);\n  --split:calc(var(--g) / var(--t) * 100%);\n  display:block;align-self:center;block-size:11px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--t) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.bar--now{grid-area:now}\n.bar--prev{\n  grid-area:prev;\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  --split:calc(var(--pg) / var(--pt) * 100%);\n  block-size:9px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--pt) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n/* a measured zero keeps a tick, never nothing */\n.bar[data-shape='none']{inline-size:3px;background:var(--ink-muted);background-image:none;box-shadow:none}\n.bar[data-shape='gift']{background-image:linear-gradient(var(--c-gift) 0 0)}\n.bar[data-shape='credit']{background-image:linear-gradient(var(--c-credit) 0 0)}\n\n/* ---------------- the figures: matrix, no header when narrow ---------------- */\n.figs{\n  grid-area:figs;\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:auto 2.4em 2.4em;\n  column-gap:6px;row-gap:1px;\n  align-items:baseline;\n  justify-self:start;\n  inline-size:max-content;\n  margin-top:5px;\n  font-size:11px;\n}\n.figs__hd,\n.figs__k{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n.figs__hd{font-family:var(--sans);letter-spacing:.03em}\n.fig{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;text-align:right;\n}\n.fig--free{color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.fig--paid{color:var(--credit-ink)}\n.fig--prev{color:var(--ink-muted)}\n\n/* ---------------- tablet and up: the rail appears ---------------- */\n@container (min-width:560px){\n  .lane{\n    grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) 104px;\n    grid-template-areas:\n      \"head head figs\"\n      \"tagN now  figs\"\n      \"tagP prev figs\";\n    row-gap:4px;\n  }\n  .figs{margin-top:0;align-self:center}\n}\n\n/* ---------------- delta arrows ---------------- */\n.arrows{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-top:16px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.arrows figure{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.arrows figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint);text-align:center;line-height:1.3}\n.a-small{width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.a-large{width:44px;height:44px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:4px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>One DOM, two templates: the rail appears when the container allows it</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">Named grid areas, one container query, no duplicated markup and no second component</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>The whole mechanism</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">Six grid items per lane — heading, two tags, two bars, one figure block. Narrow puts the figures underneath on their own row; wide moves <code>figs</code> into a right-hand column and lets the two bars and their tags stack against it. Nothing is added, removed or reordered. <code>container-type</code> sits on the card, because an element cannot query its own size.</p>\n    <pre class=\"code\"><b>/* narrow — figures underneath */</b>\n.lane{grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:\n  \"head head\"\n  \"tagN now\"\n  \"tagP prev\"\n  <em>\"figs figs\"</em>}\n\n<b>/* tablet — the same six items, rail on the right */</b>\n@container (min-width:560px){\n  .lane{grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) 104px;grid-template-areas:\n    \"head head <em>figs</em>\"\n    \"tagN now  <em>figs</em>\"\n    \"tagP prev <em>figs</em>\"}\n}</pre>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>390px — figures underneath</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">The figure block is the same 3-column matrix as in the wide card — heading row included — so the second figure column is never an unlabelled number. It is labelled once by row and once by column, and the previous column is muted because the heading already says which period it is. Nothing about it is hidden at this width; only its grid area differs.</p>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <p class=\"card__size\">390px container · rail off</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"lane__nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:0;--pt:0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">2</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">–</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">6</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">–</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"3.82\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">1</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">8</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">6</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>2 fewer than the previous week</title>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"10.18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">2</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">5</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">7</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"9.25\" y2=\"3.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">1</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">8</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">5</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>720px — the rail switches on</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">Identical markup. Same six items, one different <code>grid-template-areas</code>, and the figure block's heading row revealed by a single <code>display</code> rule. The bar keeps the rest of the width, so the month reads across as well as down.</p>\n    <div class=\"card card--wide\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <p class=\"card__size\">720px container · rail on, threshold 560px</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"lane__nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:0;--pt:0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">2</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">–</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">6</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">–</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"3.82\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">1</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">8</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">6</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>2 fewer than the previous week</title>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"10.18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">2</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">5</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">7</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"9.25\" y2=\"3.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"figs\">\n            <span class=\"figs__hd\"></span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Now</span><span class=\"figs__hd\">Prev</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">free</span><span class=\"fig fig--free\">1</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"figs__k\">paid</span><span class=\"fig fig--paid\">8</span><span class=\"fig fig--prev\">5</span>\n          </span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>The delta stays a clock hand</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">The needle swings between the one and five o'clock positions: above the horizontal for an increase, below for a decrease, flat for unchanged, and nothing at all when there is no earlier period to compare with — the dash in the first row. Direction is legible without reading a glyph, and it cannot be mistaken for a fifth number sitting beside four figures. The angle is coarse on purpose: three steps each way, because a needle that claims to encode an exact ratio is a lie at 14px.</p>\n    <div class=\"arrows\">\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-large\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>2 fewer</title>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"9.25\" y2=\"10.9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-small\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"9.25\" y2=\"10.9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>down far<br>2 or more</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-large\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>1 fewer</title>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"10.18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-small\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"10.18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>down<br>1</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-large\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>unchanged</title>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"11.6\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-small\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"11.6\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>level<br>0</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-large\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more</title>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"3.82\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-small\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"10.18\" y2=\"3.82\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>up<br>1</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-large\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" role=\"img\"><title>3 more</title>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"9.25\" y2=\"3.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-small\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"/>\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"9.25\" y2=\"3.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>up far<br>2 or more</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-large\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" style=\"color:var(--ink-faint)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\" stroke-dasharray=\"1.6 2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-small\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" style=\"color:var(--ink-faint)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"5.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\" stroke-dasharray=\"1.6 2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption>no earlier<br>period</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>What the threshold costs</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">At 560px the rail takes 104px and leaves the bar about 330px at a 4-bucket month, which is plenty. The threshold is a content-box width, so it is the card's padding-free width that decides — not the viewport. Two things to settle: whether 560 is the right number for a monthly hero card, and whether the week view (seven buckets) should switch at the same width, since the same rail leaves it far less bar.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-07T01:01:01.270933+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-07T01:01:45.274Z",
      "id": "var_rail_cq_1107",
      "overrides": {},
      "contentHeight": 2532
    },
    "var_rail_collect_1107": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "rail_collect_1107",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 14113,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n:root{\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  --background: light-dark(hsl(38 42% 96%), hsl(30 12% 8%));\n  --surface-2: light-dark(hsl(36 34% 93%), hsl(30 9% 15%));\n  --ink: light-dark(hsl(28 24% 15%), hsl(36 28% 93%));\n  --ink-muted: light-dark(hsl(30 9% 38%), hsl(30 8% 66%));\n  --ink-faint: light-dark(hsl(30 7% 50%), hsl(30 7% 54%));\n  --rule: light-dark(hsl(34 24% 85%), hsl(30 8% 21%));\n  --rule-hair: light-dark(hsl(34 22% 90%), hsl(30 8% 16%));\n  --rule-strong: light-dark(hsl(32 18% 70%), hsl(30 8% 30%));\n  --accent: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 37%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --gift: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 43%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --gift-ink: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 39%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --credit-ink: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 36%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n  --serif: ui-serif, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\np,ul,pre{margin:0}\nul{padding:0;list-style:none}\n.page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 48px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.head h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em}\n.sub{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:4px}\n.block{margin-top:34px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.block h2{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}\n.note{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:74ch}\n.note code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;background:var(--surface-2);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}\n\n.code{\n  margin-top:14px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface-2);\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-hair);border-radius:8px;overflow-x:auto;\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);max-width:660px;\n}\n.code b{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.code em{font-style:normal;color:var(--credit-ink)}\n\n.card{\n  width:390px;max-width:100%;margin-top:16px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:10px;\n  container-type:inline-size;\n}\n.card--wide{width:720px}\n.card h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.card .sub{font-size:12px}\n.card__size{margin-top:2px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}\n.legend li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:1px;display:inline-block}\n.sw--gift{background:var(--gift)}\n.sw--credit{background:var(--accent)}\n.sw--prev{\n  background:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background)) 0 calc(50% - 1px),\n    var(--background) calc(50% - 1px) calc(50% + 1px),\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background)) calc(50% + 1px) 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n\n/* ================= the lane, narrow: figures under their own bar ================= */\n.lanes{margin-top:10px}\n.lane{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) auto;\n  grid-template-areas:\n    \"head head head\"\n    \"tagN now  now\"\n    \".    fN   pN\"\n    \"tagP prev prev\"\n    \".    fP   pP\";\n  column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;\n  padding:11px 0;\n  border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);\n  align-items:center;\n}\n.lane:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n\n.lane__head{grid-area:head;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\n.lane__date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* the arrow is oriented on an invisible clock face: no dial is drawn */\n.delta{\n  margin-inline-start:auto;width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;align-self:center;\n  color:var(--ink-muted);\n  transform:rotate(var(--rot,0deg));\n  transform-origin:22% 50%;\n}\n.lane__nodash{margin-inline-start:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n\n.lane__tag{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);align-self:center}\n.lane__tag--now{grid-area:tagN}\n.lane__tag--prev{grid-area:tagP}\n\n.bar{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);--c-credit:var(--accent);\n  --split:calc(var(--g) / var(--t) * 100%);\n  display:block;align-self:center;block-size:11px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--t) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.bar--now{grid-area:now}\n.bar--prev{\n  grid-area:prev;\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  --split:calc(var(--pg) / var(--pt) * 100%);\n  block-size:9px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--pt) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n/* measured zero keeps a tick; an absent period keeps nothing */\n.bar[data-shape='none']{inline-size:3px;background:var(--ink-muted);background-image:none;box-shadow:none}\n.bar[data-shape='gift']{background-image:linear-gradient(var(--c-gift) 0 0)}\n.bar[data-shape='credit']{background-image:linear-gradient(var(--c-credit) 0 0)}\n.bar--absent{inline-size:0;background-image:none;box-shadow:none}\n\n/* values: one element each, so they can be spread under a bar or collected into the rail */\n.v{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;white-space:nowrap;align-self:center;\n}\n.v i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-inline-start:3px}\n.v--free{color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.v--paid{color:var(--credit-ink)}\n.v--prev{color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.v--now-free{grid-area:fN;justify-self:start}\n.v--now-paid{grid-area:pN;justify-self:end}\n.v--prev-free{grid-area:fP;justify-self:start}\n.v--prev-paid{grid-area:pP;justify-self:end}\n\n/* the rail's own scaffolding: not needed while the values sit under their bar */\n.k,.h{display:none}\n.k--free{grid-area:kfree}\n.k--paid{grid-area:kpaid}\n.h--blank{grid-area:hk}\n.h--now{grid-area:hnow}\n.h--prev{grid-area:hprev}\n\n/* ================= wide: the same items, collected into a rail ================= */\n@container (min-width:560px){\n  .lane{\n    grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) 1.9em 2.5em 2.5em;\n    grid-template-areas:\n      \"head  head  hk    hnow  hprev\"\n      \"tagN  now   kfree fN    fP\"\n      \"tagP  prev  kpaid pN    pP\";\n    row-gap:3px;\n  }\n  .v i{display:none}\n  .v{justify-self:stretch;text-align:right}\n  .k,.h{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);align-self:center}\n  .h{letter-spacing:.03em}\n}\n\n/* ================= arrow states ================= */\n.arrows{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-top:16px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.arrows figure{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.arrows figcaption{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);text-align:center;line-height:1.35}\n.a-lg{width:46px;height:46px;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.a-sm{width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:-4px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>The rail collect, the bars distribute</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">Values are individual grid items: spread under their own bar when narrow, gathered into a rail when wide</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>The mechanism</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">Nine items per lane: a heading, two tags, two bars, four values — plus three small labels the rail needs and the narrow layout does not. Narrow places each pair of values on a row of its own beneath its bar and justifies them between, so the words travel with the number and no column heading is needed. Wide gathers all four into three columns at the right, where the headings do need to be stated.</p>\n    <pre class=\"code\"><b>/* narrow — values under their own bar, justified between */</b>\n.lane{grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:\n  \"head head head\"\n  \"tagN now  now\"\n  <em>\".    fN   pN\"</em>\n  \"tagP prev prev\"\n  <em>\".    fP   pP\"</em>}\n.v--now-free{justify-self:<em>start</em>}   <b>/* 2 free */</b>\n.v--now-paid{justify-self:<em>end</em>}     <b>/* 6 paid */</b>\n\n<b>/* wide — the same four values, collected */</b>\n@container (min-width:560px){\n  .lane{grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) 1.9em 2.5em 2.5em;grid-template-areas:\n    \"head  head  hk    hnow  hprev\"\n    \"tagN  now   kfree <em>fN    fP</em>\"\n    \"tagP  prev  kpaid <em>pN    pP</em>\"}\n}</pre>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>390px — under the bar, justified between</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">Each bar owns its own row of values. No Now and Prev headings, because the values sit directly under the column they describe. The words ride along with the numbers, so nothing is left as a bare figure.</p>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <p class=\"card__size\">390px container · rail off</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"lane__nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev bar--absent\" style=\"--pg:0;--pt:0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--free v--now-free\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--paid v--now-paid\">6<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev v--prev-free\">–</span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev v--prev-paid\">–</span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-free v--free\">1<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-paid v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-free v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-paid v--prev\">6<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 fewer than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-free v--free\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-paid v--paid\">5<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-free v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-paid v--prev\">7<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-56deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-free v--free\">1<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-paid v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-free v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-paid v--prev\">5<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>720px — gathered into the rail</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">Identical markup. All four values leave the rows under the bars and take three columns at the right, where the Now and Prev headings earn their place because position no longer implies it. The words drop out of the values and become row labels once, which is why the rail stays narrow.</p>\n    <div class=\"card card--wide\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <p class=\"card__size\">720px container · rail on, threshold 560px</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"lane__nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev bar--absent\" style=\"--pg:0;--pt:0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--free v--now-free\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--paid v--now-paid\">6<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev v--prev-free\">–</span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev v--prev-paid\">–</span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-free v--free\">1<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-paid v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-free v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-paid v--prev\">6<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 fewer than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:2;--t:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-free v--free\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-paid v--paid\">5<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-free v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-paid v--prev\">7<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-56deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--now\">Now</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--now\" data-shape=\"both\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"lane__tag lane__tag--prev\">Prev</span>\n          <span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-free v--free\">1<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--now-paid v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-free v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span>\n          <span class=\"v v--prev-paid v--prev\">5<i>paid</i></span>\n          <span class=\"k k--free\">free</span><span class=\"k k--paid\">paid</span>\n          <span class=\"h h--blank\"></span><span class=\"h h--now\">Now</span><span class=\"h h--prev\">Prev</span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>The arrow, on an imaginary face</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">Nothing is drawn but the arrow itself. Its tail sits at the centre of a face that is not there, and the tail is the origin of the rotation, so the tip swings between the one and the five o'clock positions. That is also why it survives at 15px: the head is the signal, whereas a needle inside a drawn dial needed the dial to be read first, and at that size the dial was a blob.</p>\n    <div class=\"arrows\">\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-lg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(56deg);transform-origin:22% 50%;color:var(--ink-muted)\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(56deg);transform-origin:22% 50%\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>down far<br>2 or more</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-lg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(32deg);transform-origin:22% 50%;color:var(--ink-muted)\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(32deg);transform-origin:22% 50%\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>down<br>1</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-lg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"color:var(--ink-muted)\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>level<br>0</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-lg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(-32deg);transform-origin:22% 50%;color:var(--ink-muted)\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(-32deg);transform-origin:22% 50%\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>up<br>1</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <svg class=\"a-lg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(-56deg);transform-origin:22% 50%;color:var(--ink-muted)\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <svg class=\"a-sm\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"transform:rotate(-56deg);transform-origin:22% 50%\">\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <figcaption>up far<br>2 or more</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <figcaption style=\"align-self:center;margin-top:22px\">no earlier period<br>dash, no arrow</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>What is still open</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">The threshold is 560px of card content box. Whether the seven-bucket week should use the same figure is doubtful: the rail takes the same 104px and leaves each bucket far less bar, so the week probably wants to switch later than the month. That is one number to decide, not a structural question.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-07T01:06:47.959380+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-07T01:07:32.303Z",
      "id": "var_rail_collect_1107",
      "overrides": {},
      "contentHeight": 2444
    },
    "var_narrow_place_1107": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "narrow_place_1107",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 15653,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n:root{\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  --background: light-dark(hsl(38 42% 96%), hsl(30 12% 8%));\n  --surface-2: light-dark(hsl(36 34% 93%), hsl(30 9% 15%));\n  --ink: light-dark(hsl(28 24% 15%), hsl(36 28% 93%));\n  --ink-muted: light-dark(hsl(30 9% 38%), hsl(30 8% 66%));\n  --ink-faint: light-dark(hsl(30 7% 50%), hsl(30 7% 54%));\n  --rule: light-dark(hsl(34 24% 85%), hsl(30 8% 21%));\n  --rule-hair: light-dark(hsl(34 22% 90%), hsl(30 8% 16%));\n  --rule-strong: light-dark(hsl(32 18% 70%), hsl(30 8% 30%));\n  --accent: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 37%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --gift: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 43%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --gift-ink: light-dark(hsl(168 18% 39%), hsl(168 24% 54%));\n  --credit-ink: light-dark(hsl(30 74% 36%), hsl(34 82% 60%));\n  --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;\n  --serif: ui-serif, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\np,ul{margin:0}\nul{padding:0;list-style:none}\n.page{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px 48px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.head h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em}\n.sub{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:4px}\n.block{margin-top:34px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.block h2{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}\n.note{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:74ch}\n.note code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;background:var(--surface-2);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}\n\n.card{\n  width:390px;max-width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:16px;box-sizing:border-box;\n  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:10px;\n}\n.card h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.card .sub{font-size:12px}\n.tagline{\n  display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-top:20px;\n}\n.tagline b{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}\n.tagline span{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}\n.legend li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:1px;display:inline-block}\n.sw--gift{background:var(--gift)}\n.sw--credit{background:var(--accent)}\n.sw--prev{\n  background:linear-gradient(to top,\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background)) 0 calc(50% - 1px),\n    var(--background) calc(50% - 1px) calc(50% + 1px),\n    color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background)) calc(50% + 1px) 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n\n/* ---------------- lane, shared shell ---------------- */\n.lanes{margin-top:8px}\n.lane{\n  display:grid;\n  grid-template-columns:22px minmax(0,1fr);\n  column-gap:8px;row-gap:2px;\n  padding:10px 0;\n  border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);\n  align-items:center;\n}\n.lane:last-child{border-block-end:0}\n.lane__head{grid-column:1 / -1;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\n.lane__date{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink)}\n.delta{\n  margin-inline-start:auto;width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;align-self:center;color:var(--ink-muted);\n  transform:rotate(var(--rot,0deg));transform-origin:22% 50%;\n}\n.nodash{margin-inline-start:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n.tag{grid-column:1;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-faint)}\n\n.bar{\n  --c-gift:var(--gift);--c-credit:var(--accent);\n  --split:calc(var(--g) / var(--t) * 100%);\n  grid-column:2;display:block;align-self:center;block-size:11px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--t) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  background-image:linear-gradient(to right,\n    var(--c-gift) 0 var(--split),\n    var(--background) var(--split) calc(var(--split) + 2px),\n    var(--c-credit) calc(var(--split) + 2px) 100%);\n  background-repeat:no-repeat;\n}\n.bar--prev{\n  --c-gift:color-mix(in oklab,var(--gift) 45%,var(--background));\n  --c-credit:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent) 45%,var(--background));\n  --split:calc(var(--pg) / var(--pt) * 100%);\n  block-size:9px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--pt) / var(--max) * 100%);\n  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink-faint);\n}\n.bar--absent{inline-size:0;background-image:none;box-shadow:none}\n.bar[data-shape='none']{inline-size:3px;background:var(--ink-muted);background-image:none;box-shadow:none}\n\n/* ---------------- values ---------------- */\n.v{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.v i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-inline-start:3px}\n.v--free{color:var(--gift-ink)}\n.v--paid{color:var(--credit-ink)}\n.v--prev{color:var(--ink-muted)}\n\n.row{grid-column:2;display:flex;align-items:baseline}\n/* A — spread to the edges of the row */\n.row--spread{justify-content:space-between}\n/* B — gathered at the bar's origin */\n.row--gather{justify-content:flex-start;gap:16px}\n/* C — tied to the bar's own length */\n.row--barend{\n  justify-content:space-between;gap:4px;\n  inline-size:calc(var(--t) / var(--max) * 100%);\n}\n.row--barend.row--prev{inline-size:calc(var(--pt) / var(--max) * 100%)}\n.barend-edge{grid-column:2;align-self:center;justify-self:start;block-size:0}\n\n.calc{border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:14px;font-size:12.5px}\n.calc th,.calc td{text-align:left;padding:7px 16px 7px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);vertical-align:baseline}\n.calc th{font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong)}\n.calc td.n{font-family:var(--mono);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}\n.bad{color:var(--accent)}\n.good{color:var(--ink)}\n\n.verdict{border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:14px;font-size:12.5px}\n.verdict th,.verdict td{text-align:left;padding:8px 18px 8px 0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-hair);vertical-align:top}\n.verdict th{font-weight:600;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong)}\n.verdict td:first-child{max-width:20ch;font-weight:600}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"head\">\n    <h1>Where the values sit on a narrow row</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">Same four weeks, same numbers, three placements. Max 10, so the bars are 20–90% of the row.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>The number that decides it</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">The test case is not a long bar, it is a short one. At a 390px card the bar column is about 300px wide, and the pair of labels needs about 82px of text that cannot wrap. So a bucket has to reach roughly 27% of the axis before it can host its own labels underneath itself. With this data that means a bucket of 3 fits and a bucket of 2 does not — and in a sparse week, most buckets do not.</p>\n    <table class=\"calc\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Bucket</th><th>Bar, of a 300px column</th><th>Labels need 82px</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td class=\"n\">1</td><td class=\"n\">30px</td><td class=\"bad\">overflows by 52px</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"n\">2</td><td class=\"n\">60px</td><td class=\"bad\">overflows by 22px</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"n\">3</td><td class=\"n\">90px</td><td class=\"good\">fits</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"n\">9</td><td class=\"n\">270px</td><td class=\"good\">fits, with the label at the segment end</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Three placements, identical data</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">The first and third weeks are deliberately sparse — a total of 2 and of 3 — because those are the rows that separate the options.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"tagline\"><b>A — spread to the row edges</b><span>free at the start, paid at the far right</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">1<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev bar--absent\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">–</span><span class=\"v v--prev\">–</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">6<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" role=\"img\"><title>unchanged</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:2;--t:3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--free\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">1<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:1;--pt:3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-56deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--spread\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">5<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Both values hold a fixed x, so two columns do form — but they are 250px apart, and the right-hand one sits at the row edge, which implies an alignment with the bar that is not true for any row here.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"tagline\"><b>B — gathered at the bar's origin</b><span>both values in one block, under the start of the bar</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">1<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev bar--absent\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">–</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">6<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" role=\"img\"><title>unchanged</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:2;--t:3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--free\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">1<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:1;--pt:3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-56deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--gather\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">5<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">One fixed block, always at the bar's origin. The eye returns to the same x on every row and the two numbers sit close enough to compare against each other as well as down the list. The cost is the empty space to the right of a short line — which is the same space the bar itself leaves when the value is small.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"tagline\"><b>C — tied to the bar's own end</b><span>the pair spans the bar's length</span></div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Cooks</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\">7 October – 3 November 2026</p>\n      <ul class=\"legend\">\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--gift\"></span>Gift</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--credit\"></span>Credit</li>\n        <li><span class=\"sw sw--prev\"></span>Previous</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"lanes\" style=\"--max:10\">\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">7–13 Oct</span><span class=\"nodash\">—</span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend\" style=\"--t:2\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">1<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev bar--absent\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend row--prev\" style=\"--pt:0\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">–</span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">14–20 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-32deg\" role=\"img\"><title>1 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend\" style=\"--t:9\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:8\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend row--prev\" style=\"--pt:8\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">6<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">21–27 Oct</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" role=\"img\"><title>unchanged</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:2;--t:3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend\" style=\"--t:3\"><span class=\"v v--free\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">1<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:1;--pt:3\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend row--prev\" style=\"--pt:3\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"lane\">\n          <span class=\"lane__head\"><span class=\"lane__date\">28 Oct–3 Nov</span>\n            <svg class=\"delta\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"--rot:-56deg\" role=\"img\"><title>2 more than the previous week</title>\n              <path d=\"M3.5 8h9M9.2 4.9 12.5 8l-3.3 3.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Now</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"--g:1;--t:9\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend\" style=\"--t:9\"><span class=\"v v--free\">1<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--paid\">8<i>paid</i></span></span>\n          <span class=\"tag\">Prev</span><span class=\"bar bar--prev\" style=\"--pg:2;--pt:7\"></span>\n          <span class=\"row row--barend row--prev\" style=\"--pt:7\"><span class=\"v v--prev\">2<i>free</i></span><span class=\"v v--prev\">5<i>paid</i></span></span>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Works on the two long rows: the paid value lands exactly under the credit segment's end, which is the strongest reading of the three. Fails on the two short rows — a 60px bar cannot hold 82px of text, so the pair spills past the bar's end and the paid value drifts left of where it sat on previous rows. The position of a number becomes a function of its own value, which is exactly what a column is not.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block\">\n    <h2>Is placing it under the bar actually more work?</h2>\n    <p class=\"note\">No — it is one declaration, <code>inline-size: calc(var(--t) / var(--max) * 100%)</code> on the values row, and it is the same arithmetic the bar already uses. The cost is not implementation. The cost is that it produces two behaviours from one rule: correct where the text fits, and wrong where it does not. That is why C is not a placement but a conditional, and conditionals inside a list defeat the only thing the list is good at.</p>\n    <table class=\"verdict\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Placement</th><th>Fixed column for the eye</th><th>Attached to the segment</th><th>Stable on short buckets</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>A — spread</td><td>yes, two columns 250px apart</td><td>no</td><td>yes</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>B — gathered</td><td>yes, one block</td><td>by label only</td><td>yes</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>C — bar end</td><td>no, position follows the value</td><td>yes, when it fits</td><td>no</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"note\">B is the recommendation on this reading. A is not wrong so much as wasteful — it spends the whole row's width to separate two numbers that belong together, and the right-hand value ends up asserting an alignment that is not true. C buys real attachment and pays for it with a moving target.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-07T01:21:38.462473+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-07T01:21:39.366Z",
      "id": "var_narrow_place_1107",
      "overrides": {},
      "contentHeight": 3049
    },
    "var_1a2e67ae6860": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Landing — Garden (veg-led)",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 17193,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n  @import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource-variable/vollkorn@latest/index.css\");\n  @import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource-variable/archivo@latest/index.css\");\n  @import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono@latest/index.css\");\n\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light dark;\n    --background: light-dark(oklch(0.972 0.012 85), oklch(0.190 0.014 80));\n    --foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.028 58), oklch(0.930 0.015 85));\n    --card: light-dark(oklch(0.992 0.004 88), oklch(0.232 0.014 80));\n    --card-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.028 58), oklch(0.930 0.015 85));\n    --popover: light-dark(oklch(0.992 0.004 88), oklch(0.232 0.014 80));\n    --popover-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.028 58), oklch(0.930 0.015 85));\n    --primary: light-dark(oklch(0.425 0.088 150), oklch(0.760 0.095 150));\n    --primary-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.975 0.012 90), oklch(0.200 0.020 150));\n    --secondary: light-dark(oklch(0.944 0.018 82), oklch(0.262 0.016 80));\n    --secondary-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.255 0.028 58), oklch(0.930 0.015 85));\n    --muted: light-dark(oklch(0.945 0.014 84), oklch(0.262 0.014 82));\n    --muted-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.505 0.020 65), oklch(0.715 0.018 82));\n    --accent: light-dark(oklch(0.938 0.024 150), oklch(0.300 0.028 150));\n    --accent-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.300 0.035 150), oklch(0.880 0.030 150));\n    --destructive: light-dark(oklch(0.530 0.190 26), oklch(0.660 0.180 22));\n    --destructive-foreground: light-dark(oklch(0.975 0.012 90), oklch(0.200 0.020 150));\n    --border: light-dark(oklch(0.895 0.012 85), oklch(0.320 0.014 82));\n    --input: light-dark(oklch(0.875 0.014 85), oklch(0.340 0.016 82));\n    --ring: light-dark(oklch(0.425 0.088 150), oklch(0.760 0.095 150));\n    --veg: light-dark(oklch(0.620 0.115 150), oklch(0.820 0.100 150));\n    --veg-ink: light-dark(oklch(0.440 0.090 150), oklch(0.760 0.090 152));\n    --veg-past: light-dark(oklch(0.885 0.028 150), oklch(0.335 0.032 150));\n    --meat: light-dark(oklch(0.440 0.110 27), oklch(0.560 0.120 27));\n    --meat-ink: light-dark(oklch(0.455 0.145 26), oklch(0.700 0.130 25));\n    --meat-past: light-dark(oklch(0.885 0.032 27), oklch(0.345 0.040 27));\n    --fruit: light-dark(oklch(0.760 0.140 76), oklch(0.830 0.125 76));\n    --fruit-ink: light-dark(oklch(0.520 0.120 62), oklch(0.840 0.110 76));\n    --fruit-past: light-dark(oklch(0.900 0.038 76), oklch(0.375 0.038 76));\n    --cocoa: light-dark(oklch(0.400 0.045 55), oklch(0.560 0.050 55));\n    --cocoa-ink: light-dark(oklch(0.330 0.038 55), oklch(0.640 0.050 55));\n    --cocoa-past: light-dark(oklch(0.855 0.016 55), oklch(0.320 0.018 55));\n    --chart-1: var(--veg);\n    --chart-2: var(--meat);\n    --chart-1-past: var(--veg-past);\n    --chart-2-past: var(--meat-past);\n    --chart-1-ink: var(--veg-ink);\n    --chart-2-ink: var(--meat-ink);\n    --chart-past-rim: light-dark(oklch(0.620 0.018 70), oklch(0.530 0.018 80));\n\n    --radius: 0.5rem;\n    --radius-sm: calc(var(--radius) - 4px);\n    --radius-md: var(--radius);\n    --radius-lg: calc(var(--radius) + 4px);\n\n    --font-display: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    --font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace;\n\n    --leading-tight: 1.2;\n    --leading-body: 1.55;\n    --tracking-display: -0.02em;\n    --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);\n  }\n\n  html:has(#scheme-light:checked) { color-scheme: light; }\n  html:has(#scheme-dark:checked) { color-scheme: dark; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--background);\n    color: var(--foreground);\n    font-family: var(--font-sans);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: var(--leading-body);\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n  }\n\n  h1, h2, h3, p, dl, dd, dt, ol, ul, fieldset, legend { margin: 0; }\n  ul, ol { padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n\n  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--ring);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1152px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .wrap { padding: 0 32px; } }\n\n  .label {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n\n  /* header */\n  .site-header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .site-header .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; height: 80px; }\n  .wordmark {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    color: var(--foreground);\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  .site-nav { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .site-nav { display: flex; } }\n  .site-nav a { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted-foreground); text-decoration: none; }\n  .site-nav a:hover { color: var(--foreground); }\n  .btn {\n    margin-left: auto;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    min-height: 44px;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--primary);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    background: var(--primary);\n    color: var(--primary-foreground);\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    transition: background-color 120ms var(--ease-out), transform 120ms var(--ease-out);\n  }\n  .btn:hover { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary) 92%, var(--foreground)); }\n  .btn:active { transform: scale(0.97); }\n\n  /* hero */\n  .hero { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .hero__inner { padding: 40px 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .hero__inner { padding: 48px 0; } }\n  .hero__grid { display: grid; gap: 24px; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .hero__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 336px; gap: 64px; align-items: end; }\n  }\n  .hero__title { max-width: 700px; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }\n  .hero__title .ln { display: inline; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .hero__title { font-size: 42px; } .hero__title .ln { display: block; } }\n  .hero__note {\n    max-width: 340px;\n    padding-top: 16px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .hero__note { padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; } }\n\n  /* recipe specimen */\n  .specimen {\n    margin-top: 32px;\n    display: grid;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    background: var(--card);\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .specimen { margin-top: 40px; } }\n  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .specimen { grid-template-columns: 300px minmax(0, 1fr); } }\n  .specimen__pantry {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 20px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    background: var(--secondary);\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 1024px) {\n    .specimen__pantry { border-bottom: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  }\n  .pantry__list { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n  .tape {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-height: 32px;\n    padding: 0 11px;\n    border: 1px dashed color-mix(in oklab, var(--border) 55%, var(--foreground));\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    background: var(--muted);\n    color: var(--foreground);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: 0.005em;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .pantry__attrs { display: grid; gap: 8px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .attr { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }\n  .attr dt {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n  .attr dd { font-size: 13px; }\n\n  .specimen__body { padding: 20px; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .specimen__body { padding: 24px; } }\n  .specimen__meta { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }\n  .tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--veg-ink); }\n  .tag__dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--veg); }\n  .specimen__title {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: var(--leading-tight);\n    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .specimen__title { font-size: 30px; } }\n\n  .stats {\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding: 12px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .stat dd {\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n\n  .pairs { margin-top: 16px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }\n  @media (min-width: 640px) { .pairs { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); } }\n  .pairs p { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; }\n  .swap__from { color: var(--muted-foreground); text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }\n  .swap__arrow { padding: 0 4px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n  .swap__to { font-weight: 500; color: var(--fruit-ink); }\n\n  .steps {\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    padding-top: 16px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 8px; }\n  .step__n {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n\n  /* process band */\n  .process { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--secondary); }\n  .process__inner { padding: 40px 0; }\n  .process__grid { display: grid; gap: 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .process__grid { grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.35fr 1fr; } }\n  .process__step { padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .process__step:first-child { padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .process__step { padding: 0 0 0 24px; border-top: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); }\n    .process__step:first-child { padding: 0 24px 0 0; border-left: 0; }\n  }\n  .process__step h3 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    color: var(--secondary-foreground);\n  }\n  .process__step h3 span {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n  .process__chips { margin-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n  .process__note { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n  .constraints { margin-top: 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; }\n  .constraint { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; }\n  .constraint dt {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n  .constraint dd { font-size: 13px; }\n  .copylist { margin-top: 16px; display: grid; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; }\n  .copylist li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .copylist li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: 0; }\n  .copylist li span:last-child { color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n\n  /* popular */\n  .popular { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .popular__inner { padding: 48px 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .popular__inner { padding: 56px 0; } }\n  .sectionhead { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }\n  .sectionhead h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .sectionhead p { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n\n  .table { margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .thead { display: none; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .thead {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr) 96px 136px 112px;\n      gap: 16px;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      padding: 8px 6px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .thead span {\n      font-family: var(--font-mono);\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--muted-foreground);\n    }\n    .thead .th--num { text-align: right; }\n  }\n  .row { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n  .row a {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 4px 16px;\n    padding: 14px 6px;\n    color: var(--foreground);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background-color 140ms var(--ease-out);\n  }\n  .row a:hover { background: var(--accent); }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .row a {\n      grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr) 96px 136px 112px;\n      gap: 16px;\n      padding: 16px 6px;\n    }\n    .row a:hover .title { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }\n  }\n  .rank { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n  .title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .figure {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .unit { margin-left: 4px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n  @media (max-width: 767.98px) { .figure { grid-column: 2; } }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .row .figure { text-align: right; }\n    .unit { display: none; }\n  }\n\n  /* footer */\n  .site-footer { background: var(--secondary); }\n  .site-footer .wrap { padding-top: 32px; padding-bottom: 32px; }\n  .footer__grid { display: grid; gap: 32px; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .footer__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 64px; align-items: end; }\n  }\n  .footer__brand {\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);\n    color: var(--secondary-foreground);\n  }\n  .footer__note { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 46ch; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted-foreground); }\n  .footer__links { margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 24px; }\n  .footer__links a { font-size: 13px; color: var(--secondary-foreground); text-decoration: none; }\n  .footer__links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }\n\n  .scheme { min-width: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }\n  .scheme legend {\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n  }\n  .switch {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    padding: 4px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    background: var(--card);\n  }\n  .opt {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    min-height: 36px;\n    padding: 0 12px;\n    border-radius: calc(var(--radius-md) - 2px);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: var(--muted-foreground);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .opt input { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; opacity: 0; }\n  .opt span {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-height: 30px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    border-radius: calc(var(--radius-md) - 3px);\n  }\n  .opt input:checked + span { background: var(--primary); color: var(--primary-foreground); }\n  .opt input:focus-visible + span { outline: 2px solid var(--ring); outline-offset: 2px; }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .btn { transition: none; }\n    .btn:active { transform: none; }\n    .row a { transition: opacity 120ms linear; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div data-kid=\"1\">\n<header class=\"site-header\" data-kid=\"1-1\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">\n<a class=\"wordmark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" href=\"/\">Chef Llama</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Site\" class=\"site-nav\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" href=\"#popular\">Popular</a>\n</nav>\n<a class=\"btn\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" href=\"/pantry\">Start cooking</a>\n</div>\n</header>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"site-hero\" class=\"hero\" data-kid=\"1-2\">\n<div class=\"wrap hero__inner\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\">\n<div class=\"hero__grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\">\n<h1 class=\"hero__title\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero headline text\" id=\"site-hero\"><span class=\"ln\">You’ve got the Pantry.</span> <span class=\"ln\">Chef Llama’s got the Recipe.</span></h1>\n<p class=\"hero__note\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero supporting description\">Your Diet and allergies are hard limits. You cook it, save it, and find similar dishes from the same Pantry.</p>\n</div>\n<article aria-labelledby=\"specimen-title\" class=\"specimen\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\">\n<div class=\"specimen__pantry\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n<h2 class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-1\" style=\"font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.16em\">Pantry</h2>\n<ul class=\"pantry__list\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2\">\n<li class=\"tape\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2-1\">firm tofu</li>\n<li class=\"tape\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2-2\">day-old rice</li>\n<li class=\"tape\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2-3\">soy sauce</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"pantry__attrs\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2\">\n<div class=\"attr\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-1\"><dt data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-1-1\">Diet</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-1-2\">vegan</dd></div>\n<div class=\"attr\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-2\"><dt data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-2-1\">Allergy</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-2-2\">sesame</dd></div>\n<div class=\"attr\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-3\"><dt data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-3-1\">Servings</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2-3-2\">2</dd></div>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"specimen__body\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\">\n<div class=\"specimen__meta\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1-1\" style=\"font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.16em\">Example Recipe</p>\n<p class=\"tag\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tag__dot\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1-2-1\"></span>vegan</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"specimen__title\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" id=\"specimen-title\">Tofu fried rice</h2>\n<dl class=\"stats\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3\">\n<div class=\"stat\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-1\"><dt class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-1-1\">Minutes</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-1-2\">25</dd></div>\n<div class=\"stat\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-2\"><dt class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-2-1\">Servings</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-2-2\">2</dd></div>\n<div class=\"stat\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-3\"><dt class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-3-1\">kcal per serving</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3-3-2\">480</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"pairs\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-1-1\">Staples</p>\n<p data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-1-2\">neutral oil, salt</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2-1\">Swap</p>\n<p data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2-2\"><span class=\"swap__from\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2-2-1\">chicken</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swap__arrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2-2-2\">→</span><span class=\"swap__to\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-4-2-2-3\">firm tofu</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"steps\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5\">\n<li class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-1-1\">1</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-1-2\">Heat the oil in a wide pan until it shimmers.</span></li>\n<li class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-2-1\">2</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-2-2\">Fry the tofu in a single layer until the edges crisp, then push it to one side.</span></li>\n<li class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-3-1\">3</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-3-2\">Add the rice, break it up, and press it flat for a minute.</span></li>\n<li class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step__n\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-4-1\">4</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-5-4-2\">Splash in the soy sauce, toss hard, and serve from the pan.</span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"process-heading\" class=\"process\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n<div class=\"wrap process__inner\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n<h2 class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" id=\"process-heading\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%)\">How a cook runs</h2>\n<ol class=\"process__grid\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n<li class=\"process__step\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1-1\">1</span>Add Pantry ingredients</h3>\n<ul class=\"process__chips\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2\">\n<li class=\"tape\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2-1\">firm tofu</li>\n<li class=\"tape\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2-2\">day-old rice</li>\n<li class=\"tape\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2-3\">soy sauce</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"process__note\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3\">3 or more ingredients.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"process__step\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-1\">2</span>Chef Llama writes one Recipe</h3>\n<dl class=\"constraints\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2\">\n<div class=\"constraint\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1\"><dt data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1-1\">Diet</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1-2\">vegan</dd></div>\n<div class=\"constraint\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-2\"><dt data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-2-1\">Allergy</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-2-2\">sesame</dd></div>\n<div class=\"constraint\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-3\"><dt data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-3-1\">Servings</dt><dd data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-3-2\">2</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"process__note\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3\" style=\"max-width:44ch\">Diet and allergies are hard limits. kcal and cook time are targets. A chip that breaks the Diet comes back as a Swap.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"process__step\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-1-1\">3</span>Cook the Recipe</h3>\n<ul class=\"copylist\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2\">\n<li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-1\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-1-1\">Method</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-1-2\">every step, numbered</span></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-2\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-2-1\">Save</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-2-2\">one tap to Saved</span></li>\n<li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-3\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-3-1\">Similar</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-3-2\">dishes near this one</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"popular-heading\" class=\"popular\" data-kid=\"1-4\" id=\"popular\">\n<div class=\"wrap popular__inner\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\">\n<div class=\"sectionhead\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1\" id=\"popular-heading\">Popular</h2>\n<p data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-2\">Ranked by saves in the last 7 days</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"thead\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1-1\">Rank</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1-2\">Recipe</span>\n<span class=\"th--num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1-3\">Minutes</span>\n<span class=\"th--num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1-4\">kcal per serving</span>\n<span class=\"th--num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1-5\">7-day saves</span>\n</div>\n<ol data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2\">\n<li class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1\" href=\"/recipes/skillet-beans\">\n<span class=\"rank\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-1\">1</span>\n<span class=\"title\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-2\">Skillet beans and greens</span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-3\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-3-1\">25</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-3-2\">min</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-4\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-4-1\">410</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-4-2\">kcal</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-5\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-5-1\">86</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-1-1-5-2\">saves</span></span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"/recipes/lemon-lentils\">\n<span class=\"rank\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-1\">2</span>\n<span class=\"title\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-2\">Lemon lentils with herbs</span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-3\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-3-1\">35</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-3-2\">min</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-4\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-4-1\">380</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-4-2\">kcal</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-5\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-5-1\">61</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-1-5-2\">saves</span></span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1\" href=\"/recipes/garlic-oil-pasta\">\n<span class=\"rank\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-1\">3</span>\n<span class=\"title\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-2\">Garlic oil pasta with kale</span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-3\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-3-1\">20</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-3-2\">min</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-4\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-4-1\">520</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-4-2\">kcal</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-5\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-5-1\">44</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-3-1-5-2\">saves</span></span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1\" href=\"/recipes/roast-squash-chickpeas\">\n<span class=\"rank\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-1\">4</span>\n<span class=\"title\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-2\">Roast squash and chickpeas</span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-3\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-3-1\">40</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-3-2\">min</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-4\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-4-1\">445</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-4-2\">kcal</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-5\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-5-1\">29</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-4-1-5-2\">saves</span></span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1\" href=\"/recipes/braised-leeks\">\n<span class=\"rank\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-1\">5</span>\n<span class=\"title\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-2\">Braised leeks on toast</span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-3\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-3-1\">30</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-3-2\">min</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-4\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-4-1\">390</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-4-2\">kcal</span></span>\n<span class=\"figure\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-5\"><span class=\"num\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-5-1\">18</span><span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-5-1-5-2\">saves</span></span>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" data-kid=\"1-5\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\">\n<div class=\"footer__grid\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1\">\n<p class=\"footer__brand\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-1\">Chef Llama</p>\n<p class=\"footer__note\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-2\">Recipes are generated by a small model. Check ingredients and allergens yourself.</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"Legal\" class=\"footer__links\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-3\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-3-1\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a>\n<a data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-3-2\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<fieldset class=\"scheme\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2\">\n<legend data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-1\">Appearance</legend>\n<div class=\"switch\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2\">\n<label class=\"opt\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-1\">\n<input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-1-1\" id=\"scheme-system\" name=\"scheme\" type=\"radio\" value=\"system\"/>\n<span data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-1-2\">System</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-2\">\n<input data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-2-1\" id=\"scheme-light\" name=\"scheme\" type=\"radio\" value=\"light\"/>\n<span data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-2-2\">Light</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-3\">\n<input data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-3-1\" id=\"scheme-dark\" name=\"scheme\" type=\"radio\" value=\"dark\"/>\n<span data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2-3-2\">Dark</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>\n",
