e text\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted)\">We send the receipt here.</span></span>\n<span class=\"map__face\" data-kid=\"1-5-25-3\" data-name=\"face attribution for field\">System UI 400</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"map__row\" data-kid=\"1-5-26\" data-name=\"resolved row for error status\">\n<span class=\"map__role\" data-kid=\"1-5-26-1\" data-name=\"role name label for error status\">Error and status line</span>\n<span class=\"map__sample\" data-kid=\"1-5-26-2\" data-name=\"error status line sample\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-ui);font-size:13px\">The free pool has run out. Use 1 Credit?</span>\n<span class=\"map__face\" data-kid=\"1-5-26-3\" data-name=\"face attribution for status\">System UI 400</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"map__row\" data-kid=\"1-5-27\" data-name=\"resolved row for empty state\">\n<span class=\"map__role\" data-kid=\"1-5-27-1\" data-name=\"role name label for empty state\">Empty-state body</span>\n<span class=\"map__sample\" data-kid=\"1-5-27-2\" data-name=\"empty state body sample\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-read);font-size:15px\">Add what is in the fridge and Chef Llama writes the first recipe from it.</span>\n<span class=\"map__face\" data-kid=\"1-5-27-3\" data-name=\"face attribution for empty state\">Humanist 400</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"map__row\" data-kid=\"1-5-28\" data-name=\"resolved row for timestamp\">\n<span class=\"map__role\" data-kid=\"1-5-28-1\" data-name=\"role name label for timestamp\">Timestamp</span>\n<span class=\"map__sample\" data-kid=\"1-5-28-2\" data-name=\"timestamp sample\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-fig);font-size:12.5px\">17 Nov 2026, 9:41 am</span>\n<span class=\"map__face\" data-kid=\"1-5-28-3\" data-name=\"face attribution for timestamp\">Mono 400</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"map__group\" data-kid=\"1-5-29\" data-name=\"landing group header row\"><span class=\"glabel\" data-kid=\"1-5-29-1\" data-name=\"landing group label\">Landing</span><span class=\"map